## 🔗 **Data Flow Architecture**

### **Database Schema:**
```
prdforge_projects          # Project metadata
prdforge_prd_sections      # 20+ PRD sections per project
prdforge_idea_intake       # Structured idea input
prdforge_modules           # Feature modules
prdforge_feature_nodes     # Dependency graph nodes
prdforge_architecture_diagrams # System architecture
prdforge_tasks             # Development tasks (epics/tasks/subtasks)
prdforge_guardrails        # Project constraints
prdforge_usage             # Credit usage tracking
prdforge_subscriptions     # User subscriptions
prdforge_billing_history   # Payment records
prdforge_credit_topups     # Credit purchase records
prdforge_admin_config      # System configuration
prdforge_user_roles        # Role-based access
prdforge_activity_logs     # Audit trail
```

### **AI Processing Pipeline:**
```
User Input → Edge Function → OpenRouter API → 
Parsing → Section Generation → Database Storage → 
UI Update → User Feedback → Quality Scoring
```

### **Credit Management Flow:**
```
User Action → Credit Check → Sufficient? → 
Yes: Deduct Credits → Track Usage → Update Counter
No: Show Paywall → Offer Upgrade/Top-up → 
Payment → Credit Top-up → Continue Action
```

### **Payment Processing Flow:**
```
Checkout → Payment Provider → Webhook → 
Validation → Billing Record → Subscription Update → 
Credit Allocation → Invoice Generation → User Notification
```

